{"key":"2dec67e31823a6c5","source_file":"Potts Fi.json","source_id":7581,"source_url":"concordance-fine-linen-ppl-xylinum","term":"Fine linen","headwords":["Fine linen"],"latin":["Xylinum"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Fine linen"],"latin":["Xylinum"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","AE","AR","DSS"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"2576","subsection":"4"},"text":"The fine linen interwoven, etc. (in the veil) describe the appearances in which are the Angels of the Third Heaven...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"4677","subsection":"4"},"text":"The coat of fine linen () = the Divine Spiritual in special. AC 4677:7.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"4922","subsection":"5"},"text":"Scarlet double-dyed and fine linen interwoven () = spiritual goods and truths.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"5319","subsection":"6"},"text":"Fine linen is byssinum.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DSS","section":"46","subsection":null},"text":"Fine linen--xylinum seu byssinum- = truth from a spiritual origin. TCR 220:end.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"814","subsection":"2"},"text":"Byssinum is called also xylinum. Illustrated.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"1143","subsection":"3"},"text":"As byssus which is also xylinum = truths from a celestial origin...","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"fine-linen-2dec67","url":"/meta/potts/fine-linen-2dec67/"}